{
  "id": "DEU.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Bir 31",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ayagarukire omukiikaro kya Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yayongera okubaliza Abaisirairi boona ebigambo binu ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 20:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kiro kya hati, nahikya emyaka kikumi mu abiri ey'obukuru, tinkyasobora kuba mwebembezi wanyu, kandi ekindi, MUKAMA angambiire ati: ‘Tindukwija kwambuka Yorudaani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu wenka, nuwe arukwija kubeebembera; naija kuhwerekereza abantu ab'amahanga ago goona, inywe mutakahikireyo, nukwo mulye ensi yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 21:21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'amahanga ago, MUKAMA naija kubakora nkooku yakozire Sihoni, na Ogi abakama b'Abamooli n'ensi yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naija kubabaha mubasingule, nimugendera ha biragiro byona ebimbaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube b'amaani kandi mugume, mutabatiina kandi mutabeekanga: habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wanyu nuwe arukwija kugenda na inywe, taabahemukire rundi kubarugaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yayeta Yoswa yamugambira omumaiso g'Abaisirairi boona ati: “Obe w'amaani kandi ogume omutima; habwokuba noija kwebembera abantu banu, obatwale omunsi MUKAMA ei yarahiriire baisenkurubo ngu aligibaha; niwe oligibataahya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baheb 13:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nuwe araagendaga akwebembiire; araikaraga na iwe, talikuhemukira kandi talikurugaho; habweki, oleke kutiina n'okuhwa amaani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebiraasomwaga buli myaka musanju",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nubwo yahandiikire ebiragiro ebi, yabiha banyakatagara batabani ba Leevi, abaayetwekaga ensanduuko ey'endagaano ya MUKAMA, kandi yabiha n'abakuru boona aba Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 15:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 16:13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabaragira naagamba ati: “Emyaka musanju obu erabaga neehwaho eti, ha kasumi ak'omwaka ogw'okulekera akaatairweho, ha kiro eky'obugenyi obw'ensiisira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi boona obu baraijaga omumaiso ga MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, hakiikaro ekyaliba akomere, obasomerege ebiragiro binu, boona bategere amatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osoroozeege abantu boona: abasaija, abakazi n'abaana, n'abasuuhuuki abanyakwikara omumbuga zawe, nabo nukwo bahurre, kandi beege kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe; bateho omutima okuhikiriza ebigambo ebinyakuli omubiragiro ebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'abaana baabo abatabimanyire, nabo nukwo bahurre, kandi beege kutiina MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, akasumi koona akabalimara omunsi eyorukwija kulya enyakuli obuseeri bwa Yorudaani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro eby'okumalirra MUKAMA ebiyahaire Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa ati: “Akasumi kawe ak'okufa kairiire haihi; yeta Yoswa, mugende omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu, mmuragire eby'omulimo.” Musa na Yoswa bagenda omu Heema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yazooka omu Heema ali omu nyomyo ey'ekicu; enyomyo egi, yayemerra ha mulyango ogw'Eheema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Musa ati: “Dora oli haihi kufa nka baaswenkuru; obwolimara kufa, abantu banu, nibaija kweta ha by'orwanju, bakuraatire embandwa ezabanyamahanga ab'ensi ezibarukwija kutaahamu, balindugaho, bacwe endagaano ei ndagaine nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ha kiro eki, ndibabiihirirwa muno, ndibarugaho ndeke kubarolerra, bahwerekerre, balihikwaho obubi bwingi n'emihito nyingi, ha kiro eki, nubwo baligamba bati: ‘ekituleetiire obubi bunu bwona, tinukwo MUKAMA habw'okutaba na itwe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, habw'ebibi ebi byona ebibaakozire nibagaruka hali embandwa mananu kwo ndibeesereka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nu, muhandiike ekizina kinu, mukyeegese abantu ba Isirairi boona; okibakwase omumutwe baikale nibakizina kitalibahwa omukanwa, nikyo kibe bwakaiso bwange ha bantu ba Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, obundaamara kubaleeta omunsi enu enyakwijwire amata n'obwoki ei narahiriire kuha baisenkurubo, bakamara kulya bakaiguta, nibaija kuhindukira embandwa nizo baheereze, nyowe bangaye, kandi bacwe endagaano yange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obubalimara kuhikwaho obubi n'emihito enyingi, ekizina kinu nubwo buliba bwakaiso oburukubarumiriza (habwokuba tikiri ky'okwebwa, baijukuru baabo tikyabahwege omu kanwa); habwokuba, mmanyire ebi barukutegeka kukora ntakabahikize omunsi ei narahiire kubaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki kyonyini, Musa yahandiika ekizina eki, yakyegesa Abaisirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
